  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_1489.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">Un buen pu&ntilde;ado de cohetes consecutivos han formado la tarde de este viernes&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">el chupinazo m&uacute;ltiple para iniciar las fiestas de Artesa, la pedan&iacute;a de Onda. Esta noche, a partir de las 23.59 horas, est&aacute; prevista la verbena con la orquesta La Pato en el front&oacute;n.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/FestesArtesa2014.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 339px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">Las fiestas se desarrollar&aacute;n hasta el s&aacute;bado 26 y la comisi&oacute;n ha preparado un intenso programa.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassoartesa14/img_1471.jpg\" alt=\"img_1471\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassoartesa14/img_1472.jpg\" alt=\"img_1472\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassoartesa14/img_1473.jpg\" alt=\"img_1473\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassoartesa14/img_1474.jpg\" alt=\"img_1474\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xupinassoartesa14/img_1475.jpg\" alt=\"img_1475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715